   POST   /api/recalculate/batches/{no}/validate  - 执行校验
   POST   /api/recalculate/batches/{no}/recalculate - 沙箱重算
   POST   /api/recalculate/batches/{no}/compare   - 结果对比
   POST   /api/recalculate/batches/{no}/publish   - 发布结果
   POST   /api/recalculate/batches/{no}/revoke    - 撤销发布
   GET    /api/recalculate/batches/{no}/history   - 状态历史
   GET    /api/recalculate/batches/{no}/export    - 导出结果

